id: pm-jvken3
title: "GH-678: linked-test sandbox must preserve freshly installed project extensions across child processes"
description: "GitHub issue https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/678 reports that a freshly installed project extension disappears between sandboxed child processes. Preserve isolated extension discovery state without exposing the real tracker."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-07-25T02:06:34.409Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-25T06:27:19.332Z"
author: unknown
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "A project extension installed inside a sandboxed linked-test run stays discoverable across the child processes of that run; Isolation is preserved: the sandbox never discovers or mutates the real repository tracker or global extension store; Regression coverage installs an extension inside the sandbox and asserts both discovery in a subsequent child process and non-leakage to the real workspace"
